      "content": "idk, it just feels like \"meaning\" is something for people who actually have a choice. i dont have one. every day is just more of the same. it's like im drowning in slow motion and everyone is just watching the clock. how am i supposed to \"create something new\" when i'm literally exhausted just trying to exist in this system?",
